OL,3,AOpenAI fires workers for 'mishandling
OL,4,Asensitive information'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI has fired three researchers for
OL,7,Fallegedly mishandling information,
OL,8,Fincluding work which involved an
OL,9,Fexternal organisation analysing AI
OL,10,Fmodels.
OL,12,F"Our investigation confirmed that these
OL,13,Findividuals mishandled sensitive
OL,14,Finformation outside established company
OL,15,Fprocedures, violating our policies and
OL,16,Fbreaking the trust essential to our
OL,17,Fwork," a spokesperson told the BBC.
OL,19,FThe ChatGPT-maker did not name the
OL,20,Fsacked workers, but at least two of
OL,21,Fthem were involved in safety research
OL,22,Fat the firm.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
