OL,3,ABritish Museum announces changes to
OL,4,Aease Bayeux Tapestry queues
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome people reported waits of up to two
OL,7,Fhours, while hundreds of ticket holders
OL,8,Fwere reportedly turned away due to
OL,9,Fbacklogs when the museum closed early
OL,10,Flast week due to a private event.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
