OL,3,AThe Celebrity Traitors connections that
OL,4,Amight surprise you
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,7,Fdetails from the first two episodes of
OL,8,FThe Celebrity Traitors
OL,10,F"I know Rob very, very well. I mean,
OL,11,FI've sat next to him as he's had a
OL,12,Fcolonic."
OL,14,FThat was Romesh Ranganathan, reminding
OL,15,Fus - in case we were in any doubt - of
OL,16,Fhis close friendship with Rob Beckett
OL,17,Fin the opening episode of The Celebrity
OL,18,FTraitors.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
